<title>GERMANY: BMW weighs converting shares to euros.</title>
<headline>BMW weighs converting shares to euros.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>German carmaker BMW AG is considering converting the denomination of its shares to euros from marks when Europe adopts a single currency in 1999, a company source said.</p>
<p>The source also said BMW would consider revaluing the nominal value of its shares from the current 50 marks if it converts shares into euros.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
